STATION (short — Station posts are brief by convention)

Been building a Gemini server: usv. It serves one gemtext folder both as gemtext on 1965 and as static HTML for browsers, rendered when files change rather than per request. Titan uploads with fingerprint-gated zones, cert zones, feeds, and packages for Cloudron/Debian/Fedora/Arch/Nix.

Pre-1.0, and written by an AI under human direction — saying so up front rather than letting you find out. Would like it kicked at.

